<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while expanding military activities across Latin America. President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid, met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation, and rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Journalist Omar Toledo, who denounced local corruption, was shot by motorcycle gunmen. Commander Willy, a fugitive gang boss, was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain, and a top drug gang leader arrived in Ecuador after deportation from Spain. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNS0J3akM1b0FNdUdUam1iZm1TNzZ5dEswSFlLVUUyMXFmR0hDa2NZRk9sZHJzWUpDWmZYZ3M4a283MEd5WGhyMHZIWVFTZHl3czRydXVERFNZaUJ4MzNIXzM4dFNwUm1qVGdFQ3JyMVlmcnBKR2hfU1BQb1pJTDg2bzFmcVFTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPMGxYZWY4dmd5QmRhWXhOU0Rvam5WejU5RDNWUEsxdlNKZFViN19lOTVHcFRzTDZiRkU4NWUwTWxkOGkxWS1XcGFhNVpsYTI2dm8wQ1hXa1Rwb1lNTnlBSTRvOXJ0QmptUkl0NGhNY2JObXQ1QmxUV0U4elQwa3RnMlVIVkJyanVHSzFJel8yQ3IxSFpJUHFTSTBoUVNTUGNRZ0VueTM5OFgzUGZVTVAwaThjRmI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vatican News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5ObGJnWGZYeW44U2YxVXJWazdFenpZUkQ4b1BjUlhoakJFdWNMaFJVZ05QTGxWWnliTzFtLUtKdVpUSnJFbEloR1kxam8wQ3VhYmtudFU5Uzl6ZEhXMks0WmlCZ0ZJMVJnZWNoU1lWblA3c0RV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Garnette Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNVHRWRkdIeUYydXVURGwyQVNEUFE2eVdQYUtPaXd5OW1maldXMjJlNUlxTDRqN2ZmYzEzMmxqanluaDF1LUR6eWYzdXBKSldrWldtRlZWeFFXd1pYMXpT